WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.190
Episode 24

01:46.620 --> 01:48.050
Haven't seen you for a long time.

01:48.220 --> 01:50.810
Madam, you're gorgeous.

01:51.370 --> 01:53.520
Eunuch, I'm so flattered.

01:53.540 --> 01:54.370
I wonder

01:54.370 --> 01:55.940
who want to see Xian'er today?

01:55.940 --> 01:58.110
Those who watched the princess grow up

01:58.130 --> 02:01.050
all want to see Mr. Fan.

02:01.090 --> 02:02.800
The Empress Dowager

02:02.820 --> 02:04.070
also wants to see him.

02:04.090 --> 02:06.920
But she'll see him after lunch.

02:07.580 --> 02:08.970
Who should we visit first?

02:09.090 --> 02:10.240
Madam, since you're here,

02:10.260 --> 02:13.450
you certainly should visit Consort Yi first.

02:13.620 --> 02:14.880
What about the empress?

02:14.900 --> 02:16.680
Her Majesty doesn't feel well today.

02:16.700 --> 02:18.450
We'd better not disturb her.

02:20.650 --> 02:22.170
This way, please.

02:27.010 --> 02:28.800
I know you've been to the Imperial Study,

02:28.820 --> 02:31.160
but this is the real imperial harem.

02:31.180 --> 02:32.350
Don't look around.

02:32.370 --> 02:34.010
You might be accused of

02:34.010 --> 02:35.730
being disrespectful and discourteous.

02:36.090 --> 02:38.250
Madam, you know Consort Yi?

02:38.340 --> 02:40.370
She's my cousin.

02:40.540 --> 02:42.910
The imperial family has been gracious to my family.

02:42.930 --> 02:44.420
Then why do you marry my dad?

02:44.420 --> 02:45.600
For what?

02:45.620 --> 02:46.700
Whatever makes me happy!

02:46.700 --> 02:49.170
I see. For love.

02:49.210 --> 02:51.640
Don't be too arrogant when you see Her Highness later.

02:51.820 --> 02:54.400
I see. I should save your face.

02:54.420 --> 02:56.520
Consort Yi is the birth mother of the Third Prince.

02:56.540 --> 02:57.760
Don't be disrespectful.

02:57.780 --> 02:59.630
Isn't the Crown Prince the third eldest among the princes?

02:59.650 --> 03:00.830
According to the tradition of our dynasty,

03:00.850 --> 03:02.260
the Crown Prince won't be included

03:02.260 --> 03:04.040
when ranking other princes.

03:04.140 --> 03:06.830
Though Consort Yi's son is still a kid,

03:06.850 --> 03:09.370
he's the Third Prince.

03:09.570 --> 03:11.330
That means

03:11.570 --> 03:13.830
the Crown Prince doesn't deserve to

03:13.850 --> 03:15.680
have any family or brother.

03:15.700 --> 03:17.370
How dare you say that?

03:18.850 --> 03:19.820
Madam, how long has it been

03:19.820 --> 03:21.120
since you last saw Consort Yi?

03:21.820 --> 03:22.830
It's been four years.

03:22.850 --> 03:24.090
It's so long!

03:24.620 --> 03:25.540
After she married into the imperial family,

03:25.540 --> 03:27.430
we seldom see each other.

03:27.450 --> 03:29.330
Is Consort Yi cold by nature?

03:30.060 --> 03:31.600
Big and profound as the Liu family,

03:31.620 --> 03:33.120
if we visit Consort Yi frequently,

03:33.140 --> 03:35.560
we might be suspected of collusion.

03:35.930 --> 03:36.990
In this sense,

03:37.010 --> 03:40.120
the palace walls actually become her cage.

03:40.490 --> 03:42.330
Indeed.

03:54.490 --> 03:56.060
How hard-hearted are you

03:56.060 --> 03:56.930
to leave me here

03:56.930 --> 03:58.010
to rot by myself.

03:58.010 --> 04:00.160
I actually have no one to talk to.

04:00.180 --> 04:02.070
After all, the Liu family
is related to Your Highness by blood.

04:02.090 --> 04:03.520
We should avoid suspicion.

04:03.520 --> 04:03.620
=Consort Yi of Nanqing=
We should avoid suspicion.

04:03.620 --> 04:05.260
=Consort Yi of Nanqing=
You belong to the Fan family now.

04:05.260 --> 04:05.290
=Consort Yi of Nanqing=

04:05.290 --> 04:05.560
=Consort Yi of Nanqing=
Why worry about this?

04:05.560 --> 04:06.980
Why worry about this?

04:06.980 --> 04:08.890
Aren't I here today?

04:08.930 --> 04:10.650
Weren't it for Fan Xian's marriage

04:10.650 --> 04:12.270
with Wan'er,

04:12.290 --> 04:14.880
I wonder when could we

04:14.900 --> 04:16.880
actually meet.

04:18.890 --> 04:20.850
You must be Fan Xian.

04:22.930 --> 04:25.920
Nephew Fan Xian pays respects to Auntie Liu.

04:27.770 --> 04:30.560
Mr. Fan, you should call Your Highness.

04:30.580 --> 04:32.320
You must be respectful.

04:33.930 --> 04:36.090
He's really a good lad.

04:39.610 --> 04:40.870
Fan Xian and others

04:40.890 --> 04:42.810
have arrived in Consort Yi's palace.

04:46.170 --> 04:47.630
Is Liu Ruyu with him?

04:47.650 --> 04:49.040
Yes.

04:51.020 --> 04:52.570
Haven't seen her for years,

04:52.890 --> 04:55.400
Consort Yi must be happy.

04:55.420 --> 04:57.400
I heard that Fan Xian called Her Highness

04:57.420 --> 04:59.250
Auntie Liu directly regardless of formalities.

04:59.420 --> 05:01.310
Consort Yi smiled happily.

05:01.330 --> 05:02.310
She hasn't sent him away

05:02.330 --> 05:04.370
till now.

05:05.860 --> 05:07.440
After seeing so many formalities,

05:07.770 --> 05:09.640
one would long for family affection instead.

05:09.860 --> 05:11.850
Fan Xian is really smart

05:12.260 --> 05:13.600
by calling her that.

05:14.490 --> 05:16.760
Who will he visit next?

05:16.860 --> 05:18.150
I've already asked.

05:18.170 --> 05:19.770
He will visit Imperial Consort Shu

05:19.770 --> 05:21.150
and Lady Ning successively.

05:21.170 --> 05:22.030
After the lunch,

05:22.050 --> 05:24.200
the Empress Dowager will see him.

05:25.890 --> 05:27.470
What about seizing the chance

05:27.490 --> 05:29.880
and making Fan Xian run into

05:30.050 --> 05:32.810
a maidservant when she's taking a bath?

05:33.260 --> 05:35.970
How do you like that?

05:41.460 --> 05:42.720
I'm kidding.

05:42.740 --> 05:45.250
It's too obvious. Nor is it interesting.

05:47.540 --> 05:48.870
Send someone to follow him.

05:48.890 --> 05:50.970
Tell me what he says.

06:06.020 --> 06:07.840
Where's the Third Prince?

06:07.860 --> 06:10.840
He's shy with strangers and dare not meet others.

06:10.860 --> 06:12.770
I really don't know what to do.

06:12.770 --> 06:13.930
When I was little,

06:13.930 --> 06:15.800
the most important thing is to play.

06:15.820 --> 06:16.650
If I was asked to waste time

06:16.650 --> 06:18.050
meeting strangers,

06:18.050 --> 06:19.190
I wouldn't be happy, either.

06:19.210 --> 06:21.630
You're really honest.

06:21.650 --> 06:22.800
You might be

06:22.820 --> 06:23.420
the first one

06:23.420 --> 06:25.290
to say that.

06:25.490 --> 06:27.030
Auntie Liu is really perceptive!

06:27.050 --> 06:28.720
What a lad!

06:28.820 --> 06:30.070
Your Highness,

06:30.090 --> 06:31.960
Imperial Consort Shu and Lady Ning

06:31.980 --> 06:33.240
are still waiting.

06:33.260 --> 06:34.070
After the lunch,

06:34.090 --> 06:37.040
the Empress Dowager also wants to see Mr. Fan.

06:39.980 --> 06:41.250
Auntie Liu,

06:41.460 --> 06:42.750
perhaps I should go over first.

06:42.770 --> 06:44.000
We are relatives.

06:44.020 --> 06:45.350
I'll visit you often in future.

06:45.370 --> 06:46.810
Go ahead.

06:48.020 --> 06:48.890
You should stay

06:48.890 --> 06:50.410
and talk with me.

06:50.580 --> 06:51.800
Well...

06:51.820 --> 06:53.630
Fan Xian is the one they want to see.

06:53.650 --> 06:55.010
Never mind.

06:55.580 --> 06:56.890
Madam, stay with Auntie Liu.

06:56.890 --> 06:58.190
I'll be fine.

06:58.210 --> 07:00.000
Ruoruo, stay here, too.

07:00.020 --> 07:02.010
Drink some tea and eat some snacks.

07:02.930 --> 07:04.970
I'll go with my brother.

07:05.260 --> 07:06.890
Just be careful.

07:06.890 --> 07:08.680
When you visit other consorts,

07:08.700 --> 07:10.700
don't be so frivolous.

07:10.700 --> 07:12.030
He's not frivolous.

07:12.050 --> 07:15.320
I find him sincere instead.

07:15.930 --> 07:18.250
You're fooled by him.

07:22.610 --> 07:24.520
Now, we're going to Imperial Consort Shu's palace.

07:24.540 --> 07:26.920
Imperial Consort Shu
is the birth mother of the Second Prince.

07:27.610 --> 07:29.630
The Second Prince is funny.

07:29.650 --> 07:31.560
I wonder what his mother would be like.

07:31.580 --> 07:32.630
Among all the consorts,

07:32.650 --> 07:34.190
Imperial Consort Shu is the most rigorous,

07:34.210 --> 07:35.650
but I worry about her the least.

07:35.650 --> 07:36.880
How so?

07:37.020 --> 07:38.560
She won't be a problem for you.

07:38.580 --> 07:39.690
Why?

07:40.020 --> 07:41.720
Because you're talented.

07:50.650 --> 07:53.130
My Lady, where's Mr. Fan?

07:53.770 --> 07:55.440
He's over there.

07:57.140 --> 07:58.540
Now I understand why

07:58.540 --> 07:59.630
she's called Imperial Consort Shu.
('Shu' is a homophone for 'book' in Chinese)

07:59.650 --> 08:00.810
What?

08:00.860 --> 08:02.010
Nothing.

08:02.300 --> 08:03.150
Mr. Fan,

08:03.170 --> 08:04.350
take a seat, please.

08:04.370 --> 08:06.600
Imperial Consort Shu will be here soon.

08:14.300 --> 08:15.580
Your Highness!

08:15.600 --> 08:15.890
=Imperial Consort Shu of Nanqing=

08:15.890 --> 08:17.050
=Imperial Consort Shu of Nanqing=
Fan Xian is here.

08:17.050 --> 08:18.230
=Imperial Consort Shu of Nanqing=

08:41.460 --> 08:42.810
Take a seat.

08:54.730 --> 08:56.340
Put this book on the second layer of

08:56.340 --> 08:59.480
the second bookshelf on the left.

09:08.340 --> 09:10.370
Your poem is good.

09:11.020 --> 09:14.480
A thousand miles from home,
I'm grieved at autumn's plight.

09:15.460 --> 09:16.830
Your Highness, I'm so flattered.

09:16.850 --> 09:18.120
Have you opened a bookstore?

09:18.140 --> 09:18.910
Yes.

09:18.930 --> 09:20.120
Do you have any unique copies?

09:20.140 --> 09:21.820
We only have novels.

09:21.820 --> 09:22.910
No ancient books actually.

09:22.930 --> 09:26.370
I heard that you wrote the Red Mansions.

09:26.700 --> 09:27.950
Actually it was written

09:27.970 --> 09:29.440
by Mr. Cao.

09:29.460 --> 09:30.880
I read it by chance,

09:30.900 --> 09:31.760
and copied it.

09:31.780 --> 09:33.400
Who is he?

09:34.170 --> 09:36.600
I've been collecting essays of ancient times.

09:36.900 --> 09:38.770
How come I never heard of him?

09:40.900 --> 09:43.010
Anyway, the book is really good.

09:43.580 --> 09:45.770
Your Highness, I'm so flattered.

09:47.730 --> 09:50.840
What have you been reading recently?

09:51.370 --> 09:52.930
You publish the book.
I will take care of the network of shops.

09:52.930 --> 09:53.760
And then we split the profit 40/60.

09:53.780 --> 09:55.600
You get 60 and I get 40. What do you think?

09:56.100 --> 09:57.030
The account books.

09:57.050 --> 09:58.890
Business.

10:00.340 --> 10:02.770
It's vulgar after all.

10:03.220 --> 10:05.650
Your Highness, you're absolutely right.

10:07.220 --> 10:09.520
Wan'er grew up in the imperial palace.

10:09.580 --> 10:11.560
We all treat her as our daughter.

10:11.580 --> 10:13.690
So I have to see you.

10:14.260 --> 10:16.480
Chengze also speaks highly of you.

10:16.580 --> 10:18.400
Who's Chengze?

10:22.850 --> 10:24.810
Oh, it's the Second Prince.

10:25.610 --> 10:28.560
My son is arrogant.

10:28.580 --> 10:30.160
He seldom

10:30.970 --> 10:32.080
praises others.

10:32.100 --> 10:33.610
His Highness and I kind of hit it off

10:33.610 --> 10:35.010
when we first met.

10:35.170 --> 10:37.210
You're probably fooled by him.

10:37.660 --> 10:39.250
He's shrewd and deep.

10:40.140 --> 10:42.570
He never hits it off with others at first meeting.

10:46.050 --> 10:49.370
I will say no more about him.

10:50.140 --> 10:52.160
You'll see

10:52.530 --> 10:54.720
after knowing him for a long time.

10:56.530 --> 10:57.100
There's one thing

10:57.100 --> 10:58.960
you probably don't know.

10:59.580 --> 11:01.280
I

11:02.140 --> 11:03.840
love reading.

11:06.730 --> 11:07.640
I know. I know.

11:07.660 --> 11:09.770
I already know that.

11:09.930 --> 11:11.510
You're a younger member of the family.

11:11.530 --> 11:12.950
I should give you presents

11:12.970 --> 11:15.160
for your visit.

11:15.260 --> 11:17.080
I'm never fond of vulgar things.

11:17.100 --> 11:19.970
So I'll give you some ancient books and unique copies.

11:19.970 --> 11:21.410
But I don't know what you like.

11:21.410 --> 11:22.390
Actually, I...

11:22.410 --> 11:23.580
Yet, even if you tell me what you want,

11:23.580 --> 11:26.160
I might be unwilling to give them to you.

11:26.850 --> 11:28.370
Just let me pick some books

11:28.530 --> 11:30.720
for you.

11:33.700 --> 11:34.960
That's fine.

11:35.260 --> 11:36.830
It won't be convenient for you to hold the books.

11:36.850 --> 11:39.240
I'll have them sent to Consort Yi's palace.

11:39.260 --> 11:42.080
Take them when you leave. OK?

11:42.100 --> 11:43.960
Your Highness, you're so considerate.

11:59.700 --> 12:01.520
Do you have anything else?

12:03.460 --> 12:04.340
Well. Well. Well.

12:04.340 --> 12:06.080
Then I'll see myself out.

12:12.290 --> 12:12.970
This way.

12:12.970 --> 12:14.690
OK. OK.

12:20.730 --> 12:21.710
I didn't expect that

12:21.730 --> 12:22.930
Her Highness is so different from

12:22.930 --> 12:23.700
the Second Prince.

12:23.700 --> 12:25.050
Imperial Consort Shu is quietly elegant.

12:25.050 --> 12:26.440
She doesn't talk much.

12:26.460 --> 12:27.730
She only talks to you

12:27.730 --> 12:29.590
because you're known as being talented.

12:29.610 --> 12:30.580
I really couldn't keep up with

12:30.580 --> 12:32.150
her sudden change of topic.

12:32.170 --> 12:33.800
Next, we'll visit Lady Ning,

12:33.820 --> 12:35.520
the birth mother of the First Prince.

12:35.700 --> 12:37.560
By leading troops in the frontier fortress,

12:37.580 --> 12:38.680
the First Prince owns the military power.

12:38.700 --> 12:40.020
If he wants to become the Crown Prince,

12:40.020 --> 12:41.720
won't he gain an upper hand?

12:43.100 --> 12:43.930
Eunuch, it's fine.

12:43.930 --> 12:45.350
No one will know if you don't tell.

12:45.370 --> 12:45.970
You...

12:45.970 --> 12:47.560
The First Prince won't do that,

12:47.580 --> 12:49.040
and he can't.

12:49.220 --> 12:50.240
Why?

12:50.260 --> 12:52.150
Lady Ning is from Dongyi.

12:52.170 --> 12:54.350
She was grabbed back by His
Majesty from a northern expedition.

12:54.370 --> 12:56.640
Back then, His Majesty was injured in the battlefield.

12:56.660 --> 12:57.970
By taking care of His Majesty day and night,

12:57.970 --> 12:59.560
she was no longer a slave.

12:59.580 --> 13:00.470
Later, she entered the imperial palace

13:00.490 --> 13:01.800
and gave birth to the First Prince.

13:01.820 --> 13:03.220
So the First Prince

13:03.220 --> 13:04.440
is of mixed-blood.

13:04.460 --> 13:05.150
Therefore,

13:05.170 --> 13:07.130
he can't inherit the throne.

13:07.290 --> 13:08.490
That's also why the Empress Dowager

13:08.490 --> 13:10.240
doesn't like Lady Ning.

13:10.260 --> 13:12.280
She was originally an Imperial Consort.

13:12.340 --> 13:13.080
Years ago,

13:13.100 --> 13:14.810
something happened,

13:14.930 --> 13:15.820
and she was deprived of her rank

13:15.820 --> 13:17.330
and demoted to Lady.

13:18.520 --> 13:20.350
The old lady is quite narrow-minded.

13:23.490 --> 13:25.950
Mr. Fan,

13:25.970 --> 13:28.880
I've not lived long enough!

13:28.900 --> 13:29.780
Eunuch, don't worry.

13:29.780 --> 13:31.260
I won't say that in front of

13:31.260 --> 13:32.260
the Empress Dowager.

13:32.260 --> 13:34.040
Mr. Fan,

13:34.340 --> 13:36.510
don't even think about that.

13:36.530 --> 13:39.240
You should mind your words all the time.

13:39.260 --> 13:40.100
There are so many old ladies.

13:40.100 --> 13:42.400
Who knows I'm talking about the Empress Dowager?

14:03.440 --> 14:04.490
=Lady Ning of Nanqing=

14:04.490 --> 14:05.040
=Lady Ning of Nanqing=
Are you Fan Xian?

14:05.040 --> 14:06.130
Are you Fan Xian?

14:06.370 --> 14:08.370
Yes, Your Highness.

14:08.820 --> 14:10.250
You have no beard.

14:10.410 --> 14:11.440
What?

14:11.460 --> 14:12.920
Your arms are not strong enough.

14:14.580 --> 14:15.910
You actually

14:15.930 --> 14:18.840
killed Cheng Jushu!

14:19.220 --> 14:21.570
He was an Eighth Dan martial arts master.

14:22.020 --> 14:23.240
I don't buy it.

14:23.260 --> 14:24.570
Your Highness,

14:24.660 --> 14:25.760
we fought on the streets.

14:25.780 --> 14:27.280
Many people have seen us.

14:29.530 --> 14:31.150
You should be more robust.

14:31.170 --> 14:32.510
Rougher.

14:32.530 --> 14:33.820
Anyway, you shouldn't

14:33.820 --> 14:35.210
be like this.

14:35.900 --> 14:37.250
Fine.

14:37.340 --> 14:39.080
Since Wan'er likes you,

14:39.580 --> 14:40.920
then so be it.

14:41.100 --> 14:42.330
That's it?

14:42.610 --> 14:43.510
Right!

14:43.530 --> 14:44.880
We just want to see you today.

14:44.900 --> 14:45.830
Satisfied or not,

14:45.850 --> 14:47.350
it's up to Wan'er.

14:47.370 --> 14:49.000
Your Highness, you're really sensible.

14:49.020 --> 14:50.650
Well. Just leave.

14:53.410 --> 14:54.800
Your Highness,

14:54.820 --> 14:55.910
the Empress Dowager

14:55.930 --> 14:58.400
wants to see Fan Xian after lunch.

14:59.170 --> 15:01.520
Go ahead. I'm not holding him back.

15:02.410 --> 15:03.240
Well.

15:03.260 --> 15:06.650
Look, it's not early now.

15:09.340 --> 15:11.800
So you're here for lunch.

15:11.820 --> 15:14.330
No, I don't. I dare not.

15:19.020 --> 15:19.930
Take a seat, too.

15:19.930 --> 15:21.170
I dare not.

15:21.170 --> 15:22.220
You don't have to mind those rules

15:22.220 --> 15:23.120
in my place.

15:23.140 --> 15:24.470
Humble as I am,

15:24.490 --> 15:26.450
I really dare not!

15:26.730 --> 15:28.250
Whatever.

15:29.900 --> 15:31.030
I've long heard that

15:31.050 --> 15:33.350
Fan Jian's daughter is both beautiful and talented.

15:33.370 --> 15:34.690
Are you engaged?

15:34.820 --> 15:35.800
Not yet.

15:35.820 --> 15:36.710
I have a son

15:36.730 --> 15:37.510
who's rather straightforward.

15:37.530 --> 15:39.650
Do you want to meet him when he's back?

15:42.370 --> 15:44.250
I haven't thought about that yet.

15:44.610 --> 15:45.410
No need to be nervous.

15:45.410 --> 15:46.640
I won't push you.

15:46.660 --> 15:48.210
Come one. Let's eat!

15:50.930 --> 15:51.910
Where's the staple food?

15:51.930 --> 15:52.880
Serve the staple food.

15:52.900 --> 15:54.800
Your Highness, I don't need the staple food.

15:54.820 --> 15:56.450
It's for your brother.

16:01.140 --> 16:02.450
It's too much.

16:02.490 --> 16:03.760
No need to hold back.

16:03.780 --> 16:06.890
To practice martial arts, you must eat more.

16:07.050 --> 16:08.770
I'm not holding back.

16:08.970 --> 16:11.250
Eat it. Fill another bowl if it's not enough.

16:20.460 --> 16:22.480
Come on. Taste the meat.

16:22.900 --> 16:24.040
Come on.

16:26.820 --> 16:28.200
Such a big bowl of rice!

16:28.220 --> 16:29.470
Did he finish it all?

16:29.490 --> 16:31.010
He left a lot.

16:35.050 --> 16:36.950
Don't you find him

16:36.970 --> 16:38.640
interesting?

16:38.660 --> 16:40.390
If Your Highness think so,

16:40.410 --> 16:41.890
then he's interesting.

16:45.260 --> 16:46.840
By the way,

16:47.170 --> 16:49.330
I'm the mother of Wan'er.

16:50.050 --> 16:51.890
Now that he's in the imperial palace,

16:51.930 --> 16:53.590
why doesn't he come to visit me?

16:53.610 --> 16:55.000
Your Highness, you forgot.

16:55.020 --> 16:57.030
You said yourself that you don't want to

16:57.050 --> 16:58.730
see him for fear that you might be bored.

16:58.730 --> 17:00.650
But now I think

17:00.820 --> 17:02.960
it might be interesting to see him.

17:03.530 --> 17:05.440
Is he still in Lady Ning's palace?

17:05.580 --> 17:06.800
Now he must have arrived in

17:06.820 --> 17:09.080
the Empress Dowager's palace.

17:09.820 --> 17:11.170
I want to see him.

17:13.820 --> 17:15.080
Wait!

17:16.170 --> 17:17.960
Fan Xian can't be the only one

17:18.250 --> 17:20.010
to have fun.

17:21.250 --> 17:22.720
Ask Xiaoyi over.

17:22.740 --> 17:23.800
Yes.

17:23.820 --> 17:25.530
Ask him to bring his bow and arrows.

17:32.250 --> 17:33.600
Have you remembered the route?

17:33.980 --> 17:35.910
I've remembered the route from the entrance gate

17:35.930 --> 17:37.390
to the Empress Dowager's palace.

17:37.410 --> 17:38.960
Draw a map when we go back.

17:50.290 --> 17:51.770
Mr. Fan,

17:52.500 --> 17:54.990
you may kneel down here.

17:55.010 --> 17:56.930
Let the Empress Dowager see you.

17:58.290 --> 17:59.480
Kneel down here?

17:59.500 --> 18:00.800
Yes.

18:01.050 --> 18:02.270
Without entering the palace?

18:02.290 --> 18:05.050
It's the Empress Dowager's order. Just kneel down.

18:05.290 --> 18:07.170
I've never knelt down before His Majesty.

18:08.100 --> 18:09.410
Just kneel down.

18:10.500 --> 18:11.440
Fine.

18:11.460 --> 18:13.480
I'm just showing respect to the old.

18:17.100 --> 18:20.080
The Empress Dowager only asks Mr. Fan to kneel down.

18:20.100 --> 18:21.560
I'll keep my brother company.

18:25.740 --> 18:26.840
Can Her Majesty see me

18:26.860 --> 18:28.650
kneeling down here?

18:33.770 --> 18:35.080
Who's that?

18:39.340 --> 18:40.890
Mind your words.

18:41.650 --> 18:43.250
It's Eunuch Hong.

18:48.410 --> 18:50.360
Who are the Four Great Masters?

18:50.380 --> 18:52.110
Nanqing has two Great Masters.

18:52.130 --> 18:55.110
One is Liuyun Palm Ye Liuyun.

18:55.130 --> 18:58.200
The other is mysterious and unknown.

18:59.340 --> 19:00.770
Rumor has it that he is hidden

19:00.770 --> 19:02.800
in the imperial palace of the capital city.

19:02.820 --> 19:04.290
There's other speculation that

19:04.380 --> 19:05.700
he is an old eunuch

19:05.700 --> 19:06.520
in the imperial palace.

19:06.520 --> 19:06.530
=Hong Sixiang, Head of Eunuchs of Nanqing=
in the imperial palace.

19:06.530 --> 19:08.870
=Hong Sixiang, Head of Eunuchs of Nanqing=

19:13.650 --> 19:15.250
The Empress Dowager said

19:15.460 --> 19:18.080
you shouldn't kneel down for respecting the old.

19:18.770 --> 19:20.170
You're kneeling down here because as an official,

19:20.380 --> 19:23.200
you should show respect to the imperial family.

19:23.220 --> 19:24.720
The Empress Dowager also said

19:25.130 --> 19:28.440
next time you see His Majesty,
you'd better kneel down before him.

19:28.460 --> 19:30.600
Can she hear me inside...

19:32.890 --> 19:34.530
You could hear me, right?

19:35.220 --> 19:38.650
You'd better mind your words

19:38.770 --> 19:40.720
and behaviors inside the imperial palace.

19:40.820 --> 19:41.770
Not everyone has a good hearing

19:41.770 --> 19:43.720
as you do.

19:44.980 --> 19:46.910
The Empress Dowager asked me to tell you.

19:46.930 --> 19:48.680
Treat Wan'er nicely.

19:48.700 --> 19:50.650
If you ever make her sad,

19:51.250 --> 19:54.010
you'll have to die for that.

20:02.100 --> 20:04.410
Eunuch Hong, please tell Her Majesty that

20:04.740 --> 20:05.820
her words might

20:05.820 --> 20:07.440
have the exactly opposite effect.

20:07.620 --> 20:08.250
They'll keep others

20:08.250 --> 20:10.130
away from Wan'er instead.

20:11.010 --> 20:11.960
Are you scared?

20:11.980 --> 20:13.270
I'll treat Wan'er nicely

20:13.290 --> 20:15.440
because I love her wholeheartedly.

20:15.500 --> 20:16.890
I'll protect her

20:16.980 --> 20:19.290
no matter what Her Majesty said.

20:21.100 --> 20:24.960
I hope you can remember your own words.

20:25.500 --> 20:27.440
Escort him out the imperial palace.

20:37.620 --> 20:39.050
Eunuch Hong,

20:39.410 --> 20:41.960
are you a Great Master?

21:05.220 --> 21:07.600
That kid is unwilling to submit.

21:07.980 --> 21:09.480
But he said

21:09.500 --> 21:11.170
he'll treat Wan'er nicely
because he loves her wholeheartedly.

21:11.170 --> 21:14.840
I think he means it.

21:15.220 --> 21:17.250
How long

21:18.250 --> 21:20.080
can love last?

21:20.100 --> 21:21.840
Your Majesty, won't you meet him?

21:21.860 --> 21:23.530
Among the younger generation,

21:23.580 --> 21:25.200
he's a smart one.

21:25.500 --> 21:28.530
I've seen him from a distance,

21:28.890 --> 21:30.080
but I don't like him.

21:30.100 --> 21:31.150
Why?

21:31.170 --> 21:32.770
I can't tell.

21:36.100 --> 21:39.510
I just feel that

21:39.530 --> 21:41.870
I had seen him somewhere.

21:41.890 --> 21:44.530
Your Majesty, that's impossible.

21:45.530 --> 21:47.440
Right.

21:49.250 --> 21:53.200
It might be fate.

21:53.580 --> 21:55.290
Just let him go.

21:56.500 --> 21:59.480
Luckily, everything goes on smoothly today.

22:00.620 --> 22:01.870
Mr. Fan,

22:01.890 --> 22:03.110
after today,

22:03.130 --> 22:05.050
there won't be any obstacles

22:05.100 --> 22:07.370
for your marriage with the princess.

22:07.650 --> 22:09.960
I'll congratulate you in advance

22:09.980 --> 22:11.930
for good luck and happiness.

22:16.650 --> 22:17.960
Well, you...

22:18.340 --> 22:20.600
I really mean to congratulate you.

22:20.620 --> 22:22.960
And I really mean to thank you.

22:23.130 --> 22:26.680
Then I'll take it.

22:43.010 --> 22:44.960
The Princess Royal wants to see Fan Xian.

22:46.980 --> 22:49.130
No one has told me in advance.

22:49.130 --> 22:50.680
Her Highness didn't want to see him then,

22:50.700 --> 22:51.700
but now she wants to see him.

22:51.700 --> 22:52.410
Well...

22:52.410 --> 22:54.440
I'm here for Wan'er,

22:54.460 --> 22:56.200
so I definitely should visit Her Highness.

22:56.220 --> 22:57.390
Please lead the way.

22:57.410 --> 22:59.390
Her Highness only wants to see you.

22:59.410 --> 23:00.630
They should wait for you

23:00.650 --> 23:02.390
in Consort Yi's palace.

23:02.410 --> 23:03.650
Brother.

23:05.170 --> 23:06.650
Please.

23:15.580 --> 23:16.630
What?

23:16.650 --> 23:18.680
The Princess Royal wants to see Fan Xian alone!

23:18.700 --> 23:20.030
He should visit her.

23:20.050 --> 23:22.200
After all, she's the birth mother of Wan'er.

23:22.220 --> 23:23.800
Is there anything wrong?

23:24.340 --> 23:25.740
The Princess Royal appears to be

23:25.740 --> 23:27.890
soft and delicate in the imperial palace.

23:28.220 --> 23:29.800
However...

23:29.820 --> 23:31.250
However what?

23:31.740 --> 23:34.230
However, if you know her for a long time,

23:34.250 --> 23:35.410
you'll feel there's something hidden

23:35.410 --> 23:37.290
under her appearance.

23:39.770 --> 23:41.080
What does that mean?

23:41.130 --> 23:42.560
It's just like

23:43.580 --> 23:46.480
there's an alter ego deep down her heart,

23:46.500 --> 23:48.110
repressed and roaring silently

23:48.130 --> 23:50.250
all the time.

23:50.460 --> 23:51.930
Though the roar can't be heard,

23:52.050 --> 23:53.890
it makes you nervous.

23:54.250 --> 23:55.740
When you stand with her,

23:55.740 --> 23:58.170
you're afraid that the beast in her heart

23:58.170 --> 24:00.530
might break free any time.

24:01.650 --> 24:03.230
I'll get my brother back.

24:03.250 --> 24:04.440
Wait!

24:05.130 --> 24:07.530
That's too rude.

24:07.620 --> 24:09.720
Maybe I was wrong.

24:09.740 --> 24:11.290
No need to panic.

24:12.290 --> 24:13.630
Don't worry.

24:13.650 --> 24:16.370
Nothing like that can happen in the imperial palace.

24:40.770 --> 24:42.110
Her Highness is waiting for you inside.

24:42.130 --> 24:43.480
Mr. Fan, please.

24:53.620 --> 24:55.930
Fan Xian pays respects

24:55.980 --> 24:58.480
to Your Highness.

25:00.290 --> 25:02.200
I heard you're a student of Fei Jie

25:02.220 --> 25:03.720
and your medial skills are marvelous.

25:03.980 --> 25:05.320
Now, Wan'er is also

25:05.700 --> 25:07.990
getting better.

25:08.010 --> 25:10.530
I just happen to know some folk prescriptions.

25:12.530 --> 25:14.600
Do you have any folk prescription for headache?

25:14.930 --> 25:16.820
Headache has many causes.

25:16.820 --> 25:18.410
My teacher also found it a headache

25:18.410 --> 25:20.410
to explain them to me.

25:22.340 --> 25:24.440
Isn't there any good method?

25:24.460 --> 25:25.650
I actually learned

25:25.650 --> 25:26.750
massage from my teacher.

25:26.770 --> 25:28.890
It might relieve the pain.

25:29.770 --> 25:31.200
Try it on me.

25:31.220 --> 25:32.910
I'm afraid it's not appropriate.

25:32.930 --> 25:35.600
Mr. Fan, you're so old-fashioned.

25:35.620 --> 25:37.250
In a few days,

25:37.340 --> 25:39.200
you'll become my son-in-law.

25:39.220 --> 25:40.650
What are you afraid of?

25:41.820 --> 25:43.440
I'll certainly obey the order

25:43.460 --> 25:44.890
from the elder.

25:57.740 --> 25:59.650
Have you started?

26:11.130 --> 26:12.990
Have you also learned the technique

26:13.010 --> 26:15.110
from Fei Jie?

26:15.130 --> 26:17.480
The acupoint recognition method
is also taught by my teacher.

26:19.290 --> 26:21.480
I do feel much relieved.

26:21.530 --> 26:23.170
It's mainly for promoting blood circulation.

26:23.340 --> 26:25.510
Insufficient blood supply to the brain

26:25.530 --> 26:26.930
might also cause headache.

26:27.740 --> 26:30.840
When did Fei Jie teach you?

26:32.860 --> 26:34.930
When I was little.

26:36.010 --> 26:37.680
I didn't expect that

26:38.290 --> 26:40.440
the Fan family is so close with

26:40.650 --> 26:43.010
the Investigator's Office.

26:43.770 --> 26:44.820
Perhaps only my father and teacher

26:44.820 --> 26:46.560
are close.

26:47.930 --> 26:50.370
They did know each other back then.

26:51.740 --> 26:53.250
By the way.

26:53.820 --> 26:56.990
How's your grandma in Danzhou?

26:57.010 --> 26:58.770
She's in good health.

26:59.580 --> 27:01.130
Good for her.

27:01.580 --> 27:03.990
Back then, I loved your grandma the most.

27:04.010 --> 27:06.560
I loved to follow her all the time.

27:06.890 --> 27:08.650
My grandma is always protective.

27:11.980 --> 27:15.510
I heard you've opened a bookstore.

27:15.530 --> 27:17.370
Danbo Bookstore.

27:17.860 --> 27:19.560
Just a small business.

27:20.250 --> 27:22.720
It's safer than being an official in the imperial court.

27:26.930 --> 27:28.890
The Niulan Street assassination

27:29.130 --> 27:30.930
must have scared you.

27:33.820 --> 27:35.800
I remember it all the time.

27:35.820 --> 27:38.010
I heard your guard was killed.

27:39.410 --> 27:41.010
His name is Teng Zijing.

27:42.410 --> 27:44.080
He's not only my guard,

27:44.740 --> 27:46.560
but my friend.

27:47.010 --> 27:50.560
Separation in life or death is inevitable.

27:51.100 --> 27:52.840
Your Highness, you're absolutely right.

28:00.860 --> 28:02.390
Did I say anything funny?

28:02.410 --> 28:03.770
No! No!

28:04.220 --> 28:05.580
I just found those words

28:05.580 --> 28:07.530
so funny.

28:07.700 --> 28:08.800
How?

28:08.820 --> 28:10.510
The person planned the assassination

28:10.530 --> 28:12.480
was actually comforting the target.

28:12.500 --> 28:14.600
Isn't that funny?

28:31.930 --> 28:33.890
The Niulan Street assassination

28:34.010 --> 28:35.960
was planned by me.

28:36.820 --> 28:38.250
That is to say,

28:38.410 --> 28:40.010
your friend was killed

28:40.770 --> 28:42.840
because of me.

28:44.460 --> 28:46.290
Isn't that funny?

28:49.650 --> 28:51.290
Why do you stop?

28:51.580 --> 28:53.320
Did you plan it all by yourself?

28:54.100 --> 28:56.600
You want to know whether the
Crown Prince was involved or not.

28:56.930 --> 28:57.910
Well.

28:57.930 --> 28:59.510
Though I support the Crown Prince,

28:59.530 --> 29:01.530
I won't tell him everything.

29:01.890 --> 29:05.110
Lin Gong pledged allegiance to me secretly.

29:05.130 --> 29:07.010
The Crown Prince knew nothing about that.

29:07.650 --> 29:09.050
By the way,

29:09.530 --> 29:11.720
Lin Gong was very obedient.

29:11.890 --> 29:13.800
It's a pity he died so young.

29:15.620 --> 29:17.620
I heard you want to

29:17.620 --> 29:19.410
avenge your guard's death.

29:20.010 --> 29:22.130
His name is Teng Zijing.

29:22.380 --> 29:23.840
No need to remember

29:23.860 --> 29:25.650
the name of a dead man.

29:30.250 --> 29:33.410
Will you avenge his death?

29:34.740 --> 29:36.560
Now there's no one here

29:36.580 --> 29:38.530
in the Guangxin Palace.

29:38.740 --> 29:40.600
Whatever you want to do,

29:40.620 --> 29:42.720
you can do it.

29:57.650 --> 29:59.200
Why are you hesitating?

30:00.100 --> 30:00.980
Aren't you seeking revenge

30:00.980 --> 30:02.770
all the time?

30:04.410 --> 30:05.720
Are you intimidated by

30:05.890 --> 30:08.250
my status?

30:08.580 --> 30:10.010
Or

30:10.410 --> 30:11.840
did your friend die in vain

30:11.930 --> 30:13.960
after all?

30:38.380 --> 30:40.370
I missed an acupoint just now.

30:44.130 --> 30:45.720
Do you feel better now?

30:48.010 --> 30:50.050
You're really good at massaging.

30:50.700 --> 30:53.340
Now I'm just

30:53.340 --> 30:55.150
slightly uncomfortable.

30:55.170 --> 30:57.680
Then I'll massage you a little longer.

31:18.460 --> 31:21.560
Your Highness, I want to thank you.

31:21.580 --> 31:23.770
Thank me?

31:24.650 --> 31:26.200
Thank me for trying to kill you?

31:26.930 --> 31:29.130
Thank you for clearing my doubts.

31:29.250 --> 31:30.250
Till today,

31:30.250 --> 31:31.500
I finally know

31:31.500 --> 31:32.930
who wants to kill me.

31:33.170 --> 31:34.370
You're welcome.

31:34.740 --> 31:35.870
By the way,

31:35.890 --> 31:36.770
the assassination in Danzhou...

31:36.770 --> 31:38.150
It was also me.

31:38.170 --> 31:38.770
Was it because you were afraid that

31:38.770 --> 31:40.650
I might take over the Neiku?

31:41.770 --> 31:42.870
At first, it was.

31:42.890 --> 31:43.750
What about later?

31:43.770 --> 31:44.980
Later I found you

31:44.980 --> 31:46.080
so interesting.

31:46.100 --> 31:47.530
It's fun to kill

31:47.860 --> 31:49.910
someone interesting, right?

31:49.930 --> 31:51.410
Your Highness, you are really perceptive.

31:51.410 --> 31:53.480
I also find myself interesting.

31:53.980 --> 31:55.290
Just now,

31:56.530 --> 31:58.170
why didn't you kill me?

31:58.650 --> 32:00.010
I wanted to.

32:00.130 --> 32:01.650
Then why not?

32:02.620 --> 32:05.010
Your Highness, I'll make you a bet.

32:05.460 --> 32:06.560
Go ahead.

32:06.580 --> 32:08.890
If I tried to kill you,

32:09.820 --> 32:11.410
now I would be

32:11.650 --> 32:14.130
a dead man.

32:14.530 --> 32:15.890
Am I right?

32:19.130 --> 32:21.480
Well, get out.

32:42.410 --> 32:43.890
How smart you are!

32:43.890 --> 32:46.250
I find you more interesting.

32:46.460 --> 32:48.200
If Your Highness have nothing else for me,

32:48.220 --> 32:49.560
I shall leave now.

32:51.620 --> 32:54.440
If there had been no one ambushing just now,

32:54.890 --> 32:56.320
would you kill me?

32:56.380 --> 32:57.680
Take it easy.

32:58.170 --> 32:59.990
The day is yet to come.

33:00.010 --> 33:00.750
Your Highness will know the answer

33:00.770 --> 33:02.770
to the question sooner or later.

33:03.220 --> 33:04.560
I'm waiting.

33:04.650 --> 33:05.960
I'll see myself out.

33:11.580 --> 33:13.050
Interesting.

33:24.220 --> 33:26.480
Director Yan, nice to see you again.

33:26.860 --> 33:28.480
We'll meet again.

33:47.130 --> 33:47.930
Master Zhuang is here.

33:47.930 --> 33:52.130
Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang!

33:52.130 --> 33:54.230
Take me as your student, Master Zhuang!

33:54.250 --> 33:57.440
Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang!

33:57.820 --> 33:59.840
Master Zhuang, take me as your student!

33:59.860 --> 34:02.250
Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang!

34:02.250 --> 34:04.150
Take me as your student, Master Zhuang!

34:04.170 --> 34:06.480
Take me as your student, Master Zhuang!

34:06.500 --> 34:07.990
Don't push! Step aside!

34:08.010 --> 34:09.180
Master Zhuang!

34:09.180 --> 34:12.580
Take me as your student! Take me as your student!

34:12.580 --> 34:15.320
Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang!

34:15.340 --> 34:16.970
Step aside! Step aside!

34:17.050 --> 34:17.950
Step aside!

34:17.970 --> 34:19.620
Take me as your student, Master Zhuang!

34:19.620 --> 34:22.430
Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang! Master Zhuang!

34:22.450 --> 34:24.970
The Beiqi mission has arrived in the capital city.

34:25.380 --> 34:27.320
Zhuang Mohan is among them.

34:27.340 --> 34:28.270
Many scholars

34:28.290 --> 34:29.530
from the capital city

34:29.530 --> 34:31.640
rushed to the gate to welcome him.

34:31.660 --> 34:33.600
Scholars around the world

34:33.970 --> 34:35.840
honor Zhuang Mohan as their teacher.

34:35.860 --> 34:37.430
His visit this time

34:37.450 --> 34:38.530
might affect

34:38.530 --> 34:40.320
the negotiation.

34:40.820 --> 34:42.250
The negotiation is up to His Majesty.

34:42.250 --> 34:45.410
A scholar won't make a difference.

34:48.580 --> 34:49.800
Anything else?

34:54.900 --> 34:56.210
Head,

34:56.580 --> 35:00.730
in recent days, secret forces
have been formed inside the Investigator's Office.

35:00.820 --> 35:02.360
I was tipped off that

35:02.380 --> 35:03.800
a lot of people want to

35:03.860 --> 35:06.410
sabotage this negotiation.

35:08.450 --> 35:10.670
They want to restart the war

35:10.690 --> 35:12.650
so as to defeat Beiqi at one stroke.

35:12.860 --> 35:14.030
Head, you're really perceptive.

35:14.050 --> 35:15.450
The First Division

35:15.620 --> 35:18.800
should take care of the things
happened in the capital city. Watch out closely.

35:19.380 --> 35:22.190
What if our colleagues

35:22.210 --> 35:23.750
are involved in the conspiracy?

35:23.770 --> 35:25.650
When the state is concerned,

35:25.770 --> 35:27.130
we should be impartial.

35:31.180 --> 35:32.690
I understand.

35:54.860 --> 35:56.230
The Beiqi mission has arrived.

35:56.250 --> 35:57.670
If the Court of State Ceremonials

35:57.690 --> 35:59.600
really negotiates with them,

35:59.620 --> 36:01.270
our plan to unify the whole world

36:01.290 --> 36:03.670
will be postponed indefinitely.

36:03.690 --> 36:05.240
No need to panic.

36:05.620 --> 36:07.670
If members of the mission are killed in the capital city,

36:07.690 --> 36:09.450
the negotiation certainly won't proceed.

36:09.490 --> 36:11.470
Beiqi can send other members to replace the dead ones.

36:11.490 --> 36:13.430
Now that Beiqi is defeated again and again,

36:13.450 --> 36:14.140
it dares not

36:14.140 --> 36:15.940
start any war.

36:15.940 --> 36:17.990
What if Zhuang Mohan, the teacher of all scholars,

36:18.010 --> 36:19.890
is killed in the capital city?

36:20.970 --> 36:24.640
If Zhuang Mohan is killed,

36:24.660 --> 36:26.510
then the war is inevitable.

36:26.530 --> 36:28.360
His Majesty will have to send troops

36:28.380 --> 36:30.760
to defeat Beiqi at one stroke.

36:30.820 --> 36:31.690
By then,

36:31.690 --> 36:33.290
your son can

36:33.290 --> 36:34.990
return from the capital of Beiqi

36:35.010 --> 36:37.730
and get rid of danger.

36:38.690 --> 36:40.140
What I do

36:40.140 --> 36:42.170
is not for saving my son,

36:42.420 --> 36:43.580
but for the grand cause of Nanqing

36:43.580 --> 36:45.560
which will last for generations.

36:45.580 --> 36:47.360
So one day, we can see the world

36:47.380 --> 36:50.230
unified as a whole.

36:50.250 --> 36:51.510
Your Excellency, you are really

36:51.530 --> 36:53.130
righteous and loyal.

36:55.580 --> 36:57.520
The Princess Royal admitted!

36:58.050 --> 37:00.750
Now looking back, it's all connected.

37:00.770 --> 37:02.010
Li Yunrui neither wanted me

37:02.010 --> 37:03.880
to come to the capital city to marry Wan'er,

37:03.900 --> 37:04.860
nor wanted me to

37:04.860 --> 37:06.450
take over the Neiku.

37:06.530 --> 37:08.730
So she passed on a fake order to the Investigator's Office

37:08.730 --> 37:10.800
to kill me in Danzhou.

37:11.050 --> 37:12.840
But you were not killed.

37:13.290 --> 37:15.080
So she tried to kill you again

37:15.100 --> 37:16.290
on Niulan Street.

37:16.290 --> 37:18.320
Now if she tries to kill me once more,

37:18.340 --> 37:20.450
it's not merely for benefits.

37:24.620 --> 37:26.320
Then for what?

37:27.420 --> 37:29.930
The Prime Minister is right about one thing.

37:29.970 --> 37:30.660
Isn't the Princess Royal

37:30.660 --> 37:32.370
the birth mother of Wan'er?

37:32.940 --> 37:34.800
That woman

37:35.940 --> 37:37.970
is crazy.

37:38.180 --> 37:39.340
If she's normal,

37:39.340 --> 37:40.620
she wouldn't tell me the truth.

37:40.620 --> 37:41.820
Nor would she use her own life as bait

37:41.820 --> 37:43.120
to lure me into killing her.

37:43.140 --> 37:44.450
She is

37:45.290 --> 37:46.800
indeed crazy!

37:46.820 --> 37:48.210
Crazy?

37:48.770 --> 37:49.950
Isn't it easier

37:49.970 --> 37:51.230
to deal with a lunatic?

37:51.250 --> 37:52.470
She's different.

37:52.490 --> 37:53.800
The crazier she is, the more dangerous she will be.

37:53.820 --> 37:54.920
Shall we tell His Majesty about her?

37:54.940 --> 37:55.950
It won't work.

37:55.970 --> 37:57.080
We don't have any proof.

37:57.100 --> 37:58.800
Even if she admitted herself,

37:58.820 --> 38:00.230
we don't have other witnesses.

38:00.250 --> 38:01.600
Then what can we do?

38:03.660 --> 38:04.900
If we want to defeat the Princess Royal,

38:04.900 --> 38:06.120
we must be patient.

38:06.140 --> 38:08.270
We'd better focus on what we should do now.

38:08.290 --> 38:10.120
Do you still remember the route to the Imperial Harem?

38:10.140 --> 38:11.120
Yes.

38:11.140 --> 38:12.560
Draw it down.

38:16.690 --> 38:18.210
Younger Master Fan Xian,

38:18.420 --> 38:20.450
Master wants to see you in his study.

38:21.010 --> 38:21.800
Just keep drawing.

38:21.820 --> 38:23.490
I'll go to see him.

38:33.730 --> 38:34.980
-You want to see me? -Your Excellency Fan!

38:35.000 --> 38:35.900
=Xin Qiwu, Deputy Chief of Court of State Ceremonials=

38:35.900 --> 38:36.440
Your Excellency Fan!
=Xin Qiwu, Deputy Chief of Court of State Ceremonials=

38:36.440 --> 38:37.320
Your Excellency Fan!

38:37.340 --> 38:39.690
I've long heard your reputation as a talented youth.

38:39.690 --> 38:40.940
Now I finally meet you.

38:40.940 --> 38:43.520
You're really young and outstanding.

38:44.380 --> 38:45.670
Look at you! Look at you!

38:45.690 --> 38:47.280
You do have an imposing appearance.

38:48.490 --> 38:50.240
Who are you?

38:50.380 --> 38:52.080
I am Xin Qiwu,

38:52.100 --> 38:53.600
Deputy Chief of Court of State Ceremonials.

38:53.620 --> 38:54.800
Court of State Ceremonials?

38:54.820 --> 38:55.710
Right!

38:55.730 --> 38:56.490
Your Excellency,

38:56.490 --> 38:57.290
now we're colleagues

38:57.290 --> 38:58.750
in Court of State Ceremonials.

38:58.770 --> 39:00.050
We should look after each other.

39:00.050 --> 39:01.270
Well. Well.

39:01.290 --> 39:03.230
Aren't I the Chief Musician of Court of Imperial Sacrifices?

39:03.250 --> 39:03.970
Your Excellency, from now on,

39:03.970 --> 39:05.690
you're a member of Court of State Ceremonials.

39:06.490 --> 39:09.760
You're sent to work in Court of
State Ceremonials for the moment.

39:10.970 --> 39:12.800
It's of great importance.

39:12.970 --> 39:15.080
You should be careful about it.

39:15.660 --> 39:17.170
About what?

39:18.820 --> 39:21.000
Your Excellency may not know.

39:21.940 --> 39:23.450
Missions from Beiqi and Dongyi

39:23.450 --> 39:25.420
have arrived in the capital city.

39:25.420 --> 39:26.920
I know that.

39:26.940 --> 39:28.970
Beiqi is here to make peace.

39:28.970 --> 39:31.450
Dongyi is here to make an apology.

39:32.010 --> 39:34.280
How is that relevant to me?

39:35.620 --> 39:38.950
As for the negotiation between
Beiqi mission and our country,

39:38.970 --> 39:42.190
Your Excellency is the Deputy Receptionist, right?

39:42.210 --> 39:43.030
Me?

39:43.050 --> 39:44.560
Right, it's you!

39:44.580 --> 39:45.970
His Majesty has issued an imperial edict.

39:45.970 --> 39:47.230
How can that be false?

39:47.250 --> 39:48.450
So I rushed here

39:48.450 --> 39:49.690
to escort Your Excellency

39:49.690 --> 39:50.920
to Court of State Ceremonials.

39:50.940 --> 39:51.880
Let's go

39:51.900 --> 39:53.690
and get prepared.

39:57.770 --> 39:59.240
It's true.

40:03.320 --> 40:07.030
=Court of State Ceremonials=

40:07.860 --> 40:09.450
Your Excellency, please! Your Excellency, please!

40:10.290 --> 40:11.600
Your Excellency, look!

40:11.620 --> 40:13.250
In a few days,

40:13.250 --> 40:14.180
we'll negotiate with

40:14.180 --> 40:15.560
Beiqi mission here.

40:15.580 --> 40:17.180
By then, we'll count on

40:17.180 --> 40:18.140
your elegant demeanor.

40:18.140 --> 40:19.320
Wait a moment!

40:20.340 --> 40:21.940
I'm still confused about

40:21.940 --> 40:23.400
the whole thing.

40:23.420 --> 40:24.470
What are you confused about?

40:24.490 --> 40:26.360
I have no experience in negotiating.

40:26.380 --> 40:28.410
Why am I chosen?

40:28.900 --> 40:30.320
Well. Well.

40:30.380 --> 40:31.990
You certainly

40:32.010 --> 40:33.230
know the answer.

40:33.250 --> 40:34.650
Behave yourself!

40:34.690 --> 40:36.640
Because the Crown Prince

40:36.660 --> 40:39.000
and the Prime Minister recommended you.

40:42.820 --> 40:44.100
The Crown Prince and the Prime Minister?

40:44.100 --> 40:47.560
Right. They tried so hard

40:47.580 --> 40:49.180
to help you build

40:49.180 --> 40:52.600
a good name successively.

40:54.580 --> 40:57.140
Well, Your Excellency,

40:57.140 --> 40:58.600
if there's anything wrong,

40:58.620 --> 41:00.080
please feel free to tell me.

41:00.100 --> 41:02.750
I will help you out.

41:02.770 --> 41:03.840
Your Excellency Xin,

41:03.860 --> 41:06.270
you're a fourth rank official,
while I'm an eighth rank official,

41:06.290 --> 41:07.670
but you call me "Your Excellency" all the time.

41:07.690 --> 41:08.950
Shouldn't it be the other way around?

41:08.970 --> 41:11.190
Well, there's a saying that

41:11.210 --> 41:14.000
man's will does not depend on his official rank.

41:14.490 --> 41:15.800
Is there?

41:15.820 --> 41:17.800
Yes, of course.

41:21.970 --> 41:23.950
Young and competent

41:23.970 --> 41:24.670
as you are,

41:24.690 --> 41:27.230
plus the support of the Crown
Prince and the Prime Minister,

41:27.250 --> 41:28.750
your prospect

41:28.770 --> 41:30.450
is beyond measure.

41:32.450 --> 41:33.690
In addition,

41:33.860 --> 41:36.690
I want to tell you a secret.

41:36.730 --> 41:39.080
I'm also a follower of the Crown Prince.

41:40.340 --> 41:41.620
I don't know myself that

41:41.620 --> 41:43.280
I'm a follower of the Crown Prince.

41:46.340 --> 41:47.510
Your Excellency, stop it!

41:47.530 --> 41:48.690
You're making fun of me

41:48.690 --> 41:49.640
again.

41:49.660 --> 41:51.050
If you're not a follower of His Highness,

41:51.050 --> 41:53.170
why would he think so highly of you?

41:54.140 --> 41:54.920
We'd better talk about

41:54.940 --> 41:56.280
the negotiation.

41:56.450 --> 41:57.730
OK.

41:59.180 --> 42:01.690
Your Excellency, here's the thing.

42:01.730 --> 42:03.010
There's someone named Zhuang Mohan

42:03.010 --> 42:05.600
in the Beiqi mission.

42:05.730 --> 42:06.600
You can treat anyone

42:06.620 --> 42:07.900
unfriendly

42:07.900 --> 42:09.170
but him.

42:09.730 --> 42:10.970
Zhuang Mohan?

42:29.140 --> 42:30.520
What are you looking at?

42:31.180 --> 42:32.730
Look at that cloud!

42:33.970 --> 42:35.800
You're so relaxed and carefree today.

42:36.530 --> 42:38.730
Doesn't it look like a pile of silver?

42:39.690 --> 42:41.510
That's definitely your style.

42:41.530 --> 42:42.180
What if

42:42.180 --> 42:44.710
I took all the silver back home?

42:44.730 --> 42:46.010
How happy my wife and daughter

42:46.010 --> 42:48.000
would be!

42:50.380 --> 42:52.450
Are we going back to the Fan mansion?

42:52.530 --> 42:54.000
Wang Qinian,

42:55.100 --> 42:56.840
have you ever heard of Zhuang Mohan?

43:19.960 --> 43:23.540
In the river of history,

43:23.560 --> 43:27.030
time goes round and round.

43:29.840 --> 43:33.180
Memories about the former and present lives

43:33.200 --> 43:37.270
join each other in an endless way.

43:39.160 --> 43:41.780
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:41.800 --> 43:44.040
one season follows another in a flash,

43:44.040 --> 43:46.540
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:46.560 --> 43:48.160
I just can't give up

43:48.160 --> 43:51.500
to be with you for my whole life.

43:51.520 --> 43:56.990
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:58.240 --> 44:00.790
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:01.080 --> 44:03.120
Year after year in the wandering,

44:03.120 --> 44:05.780
I count the remaining years.

44:05.800 --> 44:07.980
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:08.000 --> 44:09.990
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:10.280 --> 44:12.670
I never feel regretful.

44:12.720 --> 44:14.080
In such a chaotic world,

44:14.080 --> 44:17.060
I still miss you as ever.

44:17.080 --> 44:20.030
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:20.320 --> 44:22.380
With a gentle heart,

44:22.400 --> 44:25.060
I cherish our remaining years.

44:25.080 --> 44:26.600
Even though we have to go through

44:26.600 --> 44:29.110
all the hardships along the journey,

44:29.240 --> 44:36.430
you always stay by my side,

44:36.520 --> 44:39.190
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:39.480 --> 44:41.560
Year after year in the wandering,

44:41.560 --> 44:44.220
I count the remaining years.

44:44.240 --> 44:46.380
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:46.400 --> 44:48.630
even though we end up the destiny,

44:48.840 --> 44:51.020
I never feel regretful.

44:51.040 --> 44:52.440
In such a chaotic world,

44:52.440 --> 44:55.500
I still miss you as ever.

44:55.520 --> 44:58.630
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:58.720 --> 45:00.860
With a gentle heart,

45:00.880 --> 45:03.580
I cherish our remaining years.

45:03.600 --> 45:05.040
Even though we have to go through

45:05.040 --> 45:07.700
all the hardships along the journey,

45:07.720 --> 45:16.480
you always stay by my side...
